# Shopify boundary

Decided in `docs/adr/0001-shopify-as-system-of-record.md`.

- Catalog, inventory, cart, checkout, orders, customers, discounts, pages, and metaobjects live in Shopify.
- This repo renders the storefront and calls the Storefront API. It redirects to the checkout URL Shopify returns.
- Do not add payment SDKs, card fields, an order database, or admin screens.
- Do not send shipment or order mail from this app. Shopify notifications do that.
- The Storefront public token may be used by the client. An Admin API token stays server-only and out of the repo. No token is committed.
- Content layout is code. Content values are metaobjects or pages. Do not hard-code merchant-editable copy that a metaobject is meant to hold once that requirement exists.

```ts
// Wrong: charging the card in the storefront
await midtrans.charge(card);

// Right: hand off to Shopify
window.location.assign(cart.checkoutUrl);
```
